event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":89,"item_id":"rs_0eaf80f73b5e84db016aca9768ccf88193aac4fc101400e13a","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test file management**\n\nI’m wondering if I have enough time to add tests to a new file. I think about reusing helpers—should I append and edit toward the end or make it unique? It's complicated since I need to write a new test and store it alongside the existing ones. Plus, using HTTP for appending is prohibited when writing, so I need to carefully edit the last unique tail. It’s a lot to think about!"}

